  | Aphonopelma seemanni | 1.0 | £24.00 | £25.00 | +4.2% |
  
  ## 🧬 Breeder Opportunity Matrix (Top 10)
  
  | Species | Size (cm) | OOS | OOS Runs | Stock Pattern | Price Trend | Wishlist Pressure | Wishlist Delta | Signal | Recommendation |
  |---|---:|---|---:|---|---|---|---|---|---|
  | Cyriocosmus elegans | 0.5 | OUT | 4 | Sustained | → | 🔥 | → | 🔥 | Pair soon — sustained scarcity with strong buyer interest |
  | Grammostola pulchra | 2.0 | IN | 0 | Always | → | 🔥 | → | ⚠️ | Watch closely — high latent demand |
